    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuprofwetu wakutena Tira. Enu maatu amaneni akuTarashishi, kalokenu muloŋa akisapanaku dehi, hikudi itala hela kuwipililuku; anayimwekeshelichu hinsaŋu yinafumi kuKitimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwashakama kuchi kumu chakaluŋalwiji, mwenenu zo; eyi awanishililuwu yuma kudi akwakulandujola akuZidoni azambukaŋa akaluŋalwiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hameji asweja, mbutu yakuShihori, kwaŋula kwaapulaŋa awukuNile, diku kuwudiilu windi; yena wadiŋi diyi soku yakulandila nyuza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunafuukuli Tira chumichi hinyi? Mukala wavwikapa antu yibaŋula, akwakulandujola alandu jola pamu hiyatulamba, asesejapamu wowu alemahanu heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza diyi nachifuukuli kulonda kutamisha kudinka wanta kwalubanji lwejima, kulonda kusawisha alema ejima hanuheseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaTarashishi wamumbanda, kumpukaku mwituŋa deyi neyi Nile; hiwukweti nawa cheŋi muya wakuvwalaku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwelidehi chikasa chindi hakaluŋalwiji, nanyinkeshi dehi nimawanta; Yehova nashumu dehi lushimbi lwakutena Kenani lwakukisapana hawu hakolelawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili nindi, Eyi mujiki wakabishewa, eyi mwana kaZidoni, bayi wakaluŋa cheŋuku; nyamukaku, zambukaku wuyi kuKitimi; hela kwenoku hiwakamona kunookaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu ituŋa dawaKaladeya; antu awa hiyadi nawa cheŋi kwokuku; aAshuri afuukula dehi ituŋa dawu nawu dawanyama amwisaŋa; hiyakutuŋila namutuposhi twawu, hiyakusanda matalawu amawahi, himukwikala kwanyilumba nyilumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enuma atu akuTarashishi, kalokenu; mpwembujenu ajisanda dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu Tira akamuvulamena nyaka makumi atanu nayedi, mwashikila mafuku amwanta wumu; hakamana nyakamakumi atanu nayedi, Tira wakamona chuma neyi chakukamina kachivumbiwa mumbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonaku kadada, wuhiti nakunyeŋumuka mwahitamukala, eyi chivumbi avulamenawu dehi; imbaku chachiwahi; imbakutumina twatuvulu kulonda akwiluki cheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakamana nyaka makumi atanu nayedi, Yehova wakahempula Tira, yena wakafunta cheŋi kumudimuwindi wadiŋi nakudiilayi nyondanu, wakela wuvumbi namawanta ejima amumpata yamunu mwishina hewulu deseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyuma yakulandojola yininyondanu yindi yakekala yakujilikila Yehova, hiyakayisweka hela kuyitudikaku; muloŋa yuma yakulandojolayi yakekala yanawa akushakama kumesu aYehova, kulonda akadyi akekuti, akavwali yalumbuluka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
